    "question": "Which project supplies access-review records to Borealis, who leads that upstream project, and what access-related skill is recorded for that lead?",
    "answer": {
      "status": "answered",
      "answer": "Project Harbor supplies access-review records to Borealis [S1]\n\nNoah Singh leads Project Harbor [S2]\n\nNoah Singh has the skill Access Governance [S3]\n\nDEC-003 approves registering Harbor Access Register as an upstream source for Project Borealis [S5]\n\nHarbor Access Register supplies ownership and review-outcome records from Project Harbor to Borealis [S5]\n\nDEC-002 approves the access-review workflow for Project Harbor [S6]",
      "citations": [
        "S1",
